        "created_at": "2014-12-22T12:34:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I am quite out of ideas for how to give away a copy of <a href=\"http://www.gog.com/game/the_witcher_2\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Witcher 2 on gog</a> so I want to hear your ideas for it!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Post any idea for a contest, no matter how outlandish they may be, it can even include things which couldn't possibly happen in our corner of the multiverse! I will pick the 'best' one in a few days time (what with Christmas I'm not sure of my schedule) and the winner will get a code to redeem on gog.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Bonus points for including characters from Greater than Games products.</p>\n<p>Bonus points for puns.</p>\n<p><font color=\"white\">Bonus points for coloured text!</font></p>",
