        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "So I am quite out of ideas for how to give away a copy of [url=http://www.gog.com/game/the_witcher_2]The Witcher 2 on gog[/url] so I want to hear your ideas for it!\n\n&nbsp;\n\nPost any idea for a contest, no matter how outlandish they may be, it can even include things which couldn&#39;t possibly happen in our corner of the multiverse! I will pick the &#39;best&#39; one in a few days time (what with Christmas I&#39;m not sure of my schedule) and the winner will get a code to redeem on gog.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nBonus points for including characters from Greater than Games products.\n\nBonus points for puns.\n\n[color=white]Bonus points for coloured text![/color]\n",
