        "created_at": "2014-12-22T18:10:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sounds to me like you need a Pentathalon against the FV.</p><p>First, fight Legacy fisticuffs style.</p><p>Then go through Bunker's gauntlet (think American Gladiators with Bunker as the only attacker and live rounds)</p><p>Then a foot race with Tachyon. &nbsp;Mind the lake in the middle!</p><p>Next is hide and seek with the Wraith.</p><p>And finally, a competition with AZ to see who can withstand the other's environment longest.</p><p>Anyone who wins probably cheated.</p>",
