      {
        "id": 124165,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-23T17:51:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>There's only one way to settle this: &nbsp;A Super Smash Sentinels tournament!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What's this? &nbsp;You haven't heard of Super Smash Sentinels? &nbsp;It's really a great game, and I'm quite a Fanatic about it. &nbsp;It's knock-off, Super Smash Bros, is more famous, but there are Absolutely Zero things about SSB that improve upon SSS, and several things that are inferior.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Super Smash Sentinels is about to release it's 5th expansion. &nbsp;It includes several Legacy characters (Including the Mainstay of the series, the Freedom Five), but there are a few new Guise as well. &nbsp;They've also introduced the ability to change the fighters' outfits! &nbsp;Most of them look pretty good, but a few of Chronoranger's outfits look a bit Tacky-on him.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You may have heard some Miss Information that there is some Friction between &gt;G and the makers of SSS (Wizards of the Coast), but in Spite of all rumors, there have been no Setbacks, and I'm Tempest to say that this release will be the best one yet. &nbsp;HurRAh!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>(And now I really want Super Smash Sentinels to be a real thing. &nbsp;It actually sounds like it would be a lot of fun!)</p>",
        "post_number": 6,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:58:10.229Z",
