        "raw": "<p>There&#39;s only one way to settle this: &nbsp;A Super Smash Sentinels tournament!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What&#39;s this? &nbsp;You haven&#39;t heard of Super Smash Sentinels? &nbsp;It&#39;s really a great game, and I&#39;m quite a Fanatic about it. &nbsp;It&#39;s knock-off, Super Smash Bros, is more famous, but there are Absolutely Zero things about SSB that improve upon SSS, and several things that are inferior.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Super Smash Sentinels is about to release it&#39;s 5th expansion. &nbsp;It includes several Legacy characters (Including the Mainstay of the series, the Freedom Five), but there are a few new Guise as well. &nbsp;They&#39;ve also introduced the ability to change the fighters&#39; outfits! &nbsp;Most of them look pretty good, but a few of Chronoranger&#39;s outfits look a bit Tacky-on him.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You may have heard some Miss Information that there is some Friction between &gt;G and the makers of SSS (Wizards of the Coast), but in Spite of all rumors, there have been no Setbacks, and I&#39;m Tempest to say that this release will be the best one yet. &nbsp;HurRAh!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>(And now I really want Super Smash Sentinels to be a real thing. &nbsp;It actually sounds like it would be a lot of fun!)</p>",
